format-version: 1.2
data-version: 1
ontology: mspurity
default-namespace: MSPURITY
remark: Local terms for quantities msPurity writes to mzStack datasets that have no PSI-MS term (mzStack-4 R-064). Pending standard accessions.

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000001
name: interpolated precursor ion purity

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000002
name: precursor ion purity at the recorded precursor m/z

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000003
name: m/z used for purity at the recorded precursor m/z

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000004
name: peaks in the isolation window at the recorded precursor m/z

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000005
name: precursor ion purity of the most intense ion in the isolation window

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000006
name: most intense m/z in the isolation window

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000007
name: peaks in the isolation window at the most intense m/z

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000008
name: peaks in the isolation window, interpolated

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000009
name: nearest MS1 scan used for purity

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000010
name: weighted dot product cosine

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000011
name: reverse weighted dot product cosine

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000012
name: composite weighted dot product cosine

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000013
name: matched fragment peak count

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000014
name: fragment peak count in library and query

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000015
name: matched fragment peak percentage

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000016
name: per-peak signal-to-noise of an averaged spectrum

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000017
name: contributor count of an averaged peak

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000018
name: contributor total of an averaged spectrum

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000019
name: relative standard deviation of intensity across contributors

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000020
name: averaged peak cluster

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000021
name: median relative intensity of contributors

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000022
name: median interpolated precursor purity of contributors

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000023
name: signal-to-noise pass flag

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000024
name: minimum contributor count pass flag

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000025
name: minimum contributor fraction pass flag

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000026
name: relative intensity pass flag

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000027
name: combined annotation weighted score

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000028
name: MetFrag score

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000029
name: SIRIUS CSI:FingerID score, min-max rescaled within the feature

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000030
name: ProbMetab probability

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000031
name: MS1 lookup score

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000032
name: maximum biological similarity score

[Term]
id: MSPURITY:0000033
name: best weighted dot product cosine for the feature and compound
